      "source": "Query created from the string in @Query annotation in the repository interface.\n\n<pre>@Query(\"#{#n1ql.selectEntity} where #{#n1ql.filter} and firstname = $1 and lastname = $2\")\nList&lt;User&gt; getByFirstnameAndLastname(String firstname, String lastname);\n</pre>\n\nIt must include the SELECT ... FROM ... preferably via the #n1ql expression, in addition to any predicates required,\nincluding the n1ql.filter (for _class = className)",
      "translation": "从存储库接口中的 @Query 注解内的字符串创建查询。\n\n<pre>@Query(\"#{#n1ql.selectEntity} where #{#n1ql.filter} and firstname = $1 and lastname = $2\")\nList&lt;User&gt; getByFirstnameAndLastname(String firstname, String lastname);\n</pre>\n\n它必须包含 SELECT ... FROM ...，最好通过 #n1ql 表达式实现，此外还需包含任何必需的谓词，包括 n1ql.filter（用于 _class = className）。",
      "count": 1
